{
  "segments": [
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 1,
      "start_sec": 0.0,
      "duration_sec": 7.166,
      "end_sec": 7.166,
      "word_count": 21,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.0,
      "text": "Ford paid three point five million. Wells Fargo paid three billion. Purdue paid seven point four billion. Facebook paid five billion."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 7.166,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 2,
      "start_sec": 7.366,
      "duration_sec": 7.495,
      "end_sec": 14.861,
      "word_count": 22,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Those numbers got bigger \u2014 but so did the profits. The ratio never changed. The fine was always less than the take."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 14.861,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 3,
      "start_sec": 15.061,
      "duration_sec": 5.783,
      "end_sec": 20.844,
      "word_count": 17,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "So what happens when the formula reaches its logical conclusion? What happens when the fine is zero?"
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 20.844,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 4,
      "start_sec": 21.044,
      "duration_sec": 3.744,
      "end_sec": 24.788,
      "word_count": 11,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Chris Vialpondo is a renter in Seattle's Lower Queen Anne neighborhood."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 24.788,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 5,
      "start_sec": 24.988,
      "duration_sec": 7.179,
      "end_sec": 32.167,
      "word_count": 21,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "In 2022, he opened a notice from his property manager and learned his rent had increased by fifty percent. Same apartment."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 32.167,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 6,
      "start_sec": 32.367,
      "duration_sec": 4.423,
      "end_sec": 36.79,
      "word_count": 13,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Same neighborhood. Same job. He was already working two jobs to make rent."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 36.79,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 7,
      "start_sec": 36.99,
      "duration_sec": 5.791,
      "end_sec": 42.782,
      "word_count": 17,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Fifty percent meant the difference between getting by and going under. It meant counting every grocery trip."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 42.782,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 8,
      "start_sec": 42.982,
      "duration_sec": 5.423,
      "end_sec": 48.404,
      "word_count": 16,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "It meant the constant math of which bill gets paid this week and which one waits."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 48.404,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 9,
      "start_sec": 48.604,
      "duration_sec": 8.525,
      "end_sec": 57.13,
      "word_count": 25,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "He reached out to his property manager \u2014 the human being he thought had set the price \u2014 and was told nothing could be done."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 57.13,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 10,
      "start_sec": 57.33,
      "duration_sec": 5.107,
      "end_sec": 62.437,
      "word_count": 15,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Because his property manager hadn't set the price. A company he'd never heard of had."
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 11,
      "start_sec": 62.437,
      "duration_sec": 13.005,
      "end_sec": 75.442,
      "word_count": 38,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.0,
      "text": "RealPage. A company that takes confidential pricing data from competing landlords \u2014 data that competitors are not legally supposed to share \u2014 and feeds it into an algorithm that recommends rent prices across more than thirteen million apartments."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 75.442,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 12,
      "start_sec": 75.642,
      "duration_sec": 2.197,
      "end_sec": 77.839,
      "word_count": 7,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Ninety percent of landlords follow the recommendation."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 77.839,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 13,
      "start_sec": 78.039,
      "duration_sec": 5.469,
      "end_sec": 83.508,
      "word_count": 16,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "The result: coordinated rent increases across buildings that are supposed to be competing with each other."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 83.508,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 14,
      "start_sec": 83.708,
      "duration_sec": 10.611,
      "end_sec": 94.319,
      "word_count": 31,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "The Department of Justice found that the algorithm costs renters an average of seventy dollars a month more \u2014 and over a hundred dollars a month in six major metro areas."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 94.319,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 15,
      "start_sec": 94.519,
      "duration_sec": 3.296,
      "end_sec": 97.815,
      "word_count": 11,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Chris spoke publicly at the Washington state attorney general's press conference."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 97.815,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 16,
      "start_sec": 98.015,
      "duration_sec": 11.277,
      "end_sec": 109.292,
      "word_count": 33,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "He said: \"The most painful and revolting part about all of it is that all of the money I spent unnecessarily is now in the pockets of those who need it the least.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 17,
      "start_sec": 109.292,
      "duration_sec": 5.459,
      "end_sec": 114.751,
      "word_count": 16,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.0,
      "text": "The DOJ sued and announced a settlement in November 2025. RealPage has to modify its software."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 114.751,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 18,
      "start_sec": 114.951,
      "duration_sec": 7.498,
      "end_sec": 122.45,
      "word_count": 22,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Landlords have to be allowed to set prices below the algorithm's floor. No fine. No compensation to renters. No admission of guilt."
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 19,
      "start_sec": 122.45,
      "duration_sec": 5.446,
      "end_sec": 127.896,
      "word_count": 16,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.0,
      "text": "To be clear: a company was found to have coordinated rent prices for millions of apartments"
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 127.896,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 20,
      "start_sec": 128.096,
      "duration_sec": 6.478,
      "end_sec": 134.573,
      "word_count": 19,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "and the settlement was essentially \"please update your software.\" If you got caught fixing prices at a farmers' market"
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 134.573,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 21,
      "start_sec": 134.773,
      "duration_sec": 5.46,
      "end_sec": 140.233,
      "word_count": 16,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "you'd face harsher consequences. Eight hundred thousand leases in Washington alone were priced by the algorithm."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 140.233,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 22,
      "start_sec": 140.433,
      "duration_sec": 3.381,
      "end_sec": 143.815,
      "word_count": 10,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "And after getting caught fixing rent for millions of people"
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 143.815,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 23,
      "start_sec": 144.015,
      "duration_sec": 6.453,
      "end_sec": 150.468,
      "word_count": 19,
      "voice_register": "neutral",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "RealPage's first move was to sue the state of New York for passing a law that banned algorithmic rent-setting."
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 24,
      "start_sec": 150.468,
      "duration_sec": 6.154,
      "end_sec": 156.621,
      "word_count": 18,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.0,
      "text": "And then RealPage did something that tells you everything about how the formula works when it's fully internalized."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 156.621,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 25,
      "start_sec": 156.821,
      "duration_sec": 7.184,
      "end_sec": 164.005,
      "word_count": 21,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "New York State passed a law banning algorithmic rent-setting \u2014 the first state to say, explicitly, that this practice is illegal."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 164.005,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 26,
      "start_sec": 164.205,
      "duration_sec": 5.112,
      "end_sec": 169.317,
      "word_count": 15,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "RealPage's response was not to comply. Not to modify their business. They sued New York."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 169.317,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 27,
      "start_sec": 169.517,
      "duration_sec": 9.578,
      "end_sec": 179.095,
      "word_count": 28,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "The company that was just caught coordinating rent prices for millions of people went to court to argue that the state didn't have the right to stop them."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 179.095,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 28,
      "start_sec": 179.295,
      "duration_sec": 3.415,
      "end_sec": 182.71,
      "word_count": 10,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "That's not a company that got caught and feels chastened."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 182.71,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 29,
      "start_sec": 182.91,
      "duration_sec": 7.179,
      "end_sec": 190.089,
      "word_count": 21,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "That's a company that did the math and concluded \u2014 correctly, so far \u2014 that the system will let them continue."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 190.089,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 30,
      "start_sec": 190.289,
      "duration_sec": 7.176,
      "end_sec": 197.465,
      "word_count": 21,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Richard Grimshaw lost his fingers, his ear, and his childhood because Ford decided a hundred and thirty-seven million was too expensive."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 197.465,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 31,
      "start_sec": 197.665,
      "duration_sec": 5.472,
      "end_sec": 203.137,
      "word_count": 16,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "Chris Vialpondo works two jobs because an algorithm decided fifty percent more was the right number."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 203.137,
      "duration_sec": 0.2
    },
    {
      "type": "speech",
      "index": 32,
      "start_sec": 203.337,
      "duration_sec": 7.526,
      "end_sec": 210.863,
      "word_count": 22,
      "voice_register": "tense",
      "pause_before_sec": 0.2,
      "text": "The formula doesn't care whether it's a car or an apartment. It just runs the math. And sometimes, the price is zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "pause",
      "start_sec": 210.863,
      "duration_sec": 1.5
    }
  ],
  "total_duration_sec": 212.363,
  "out": "audio/breaking_law/chapters/voice_ch4_the_rent.wav",
  "word_count_total": 604,
  "avg_wpm": 170.7
}